---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact | FormFix India" description="Contact FormFix India. The owner must add a real contact address before public launch; no address is invented on this page.">
<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Contact</h1>
<p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 max-w-2xl">Write about a correction, a tool problem, or a privacy question — once the owner publishes a contact channel below.</p>
<div class="space-y-4 mt-6">
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">✉️</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">What to write about</h2><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed list-disc ml-5"><li>Corrections to requirement profiles</li><li>Tool problems</li><li>Privacy questions</li></ul><p class="mt-3 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Use the contact channel the site owner publishes here before launch.</p></article>
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">No address yet — on purpose</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">No email address is invented on this page: an invented address would send your message nowhere. The owner should add a monitored inbox and a response expectation before public launch, and update the Privacy Policy at the same time.</p></article>
</div>
</Base>
